<title>USA: Dana names John Simpson financial chief.</title>
<headline>Dana names John Simpson financial chief.</headline>
<dateline>TOLEDO, Ohio 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dana Corp said John Simpson has been elected chief financial officer effective January 1.</p>
<p>Simpson, who will also become a member of Dana's Policy Committee, succeeds James Ayers, who will retire after 33 years of service.</p>
<p>&quot;I am extremely pleased to welcome an individual with Jack's depth of financial experience and knowledge to this key position,&quot; said Dana chairman and CEO Southwood Morcott.</p>
<p>Simpson is currently vice president of finance and treasurer of Dana Corp.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
